# The packaged engine's Python dependencies: the union of the `# /// script`
# lists of every script osb-engine runs (engine.py, phase0, pitch, labelset,
# teams, playeval, jointfit, fullgame -> ballwin, roles, follow) and what
# they import. Pinned for macOS 15 and later on arm64 in requirements.txt
# (the Mac app's minimum; torch 2.12 and later have wheels for macOS 14 up,
# and without the target uv resolves for macOS 13 and stays on torch 2.11,
# which holds setuptools below 82):
#     MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=15.0 uv pip compile packaging/mac/requirements.in \
#         --python-version 3.12 --python-platform aarch64-apple-darwin \
#         -o packaging/mac/requirements.txt
# Dependabot's pull requests for requirements.txt resolve it for Linux
# (CUDA packages): compile it here instead.
